Dependencies
------------

The only dependency is **`petir`** (GPL-3.0-only), this workspace's `no_std`
numerics library, itself derived from the GNU Scientific Library. It supplies
every numerical kernel this crate uses: the matrix algebra behind decay, and
the transcendental functions behind the enrichment value function and the
geodesic distance. No `std`, no BLAS, no FFI.

